[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737544110","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104375#issuecomment-2737544110","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104375","id":2737544110,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6jK5uu","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-19T17:51:39Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T17:51:39Z","body":"If you're replacing every occurrence, then you might want to also search for `size() <= 0` and `size() < 1` since those are also found in multiple places in the repo.\r\n\r\nAlso theoretically the opposite could be done (`!is_empty()` for `size > 0 or size >= 1 or size != 0`) but might be a bit more involved than simple find and replace. Might impact readability as well, idk.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2737544110/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repo